==General election==
{{ElectionsID}}

===Campaign===
Although at first many thought Echo Hawk would win the election and become the first [[Native Americans in the United States|Native American]] governor in the United States, Batt prevailed with an aggressive campaign and with the help of a Republican tide that was especially powerful in Idaho in 1994, snapping a streak of 24 years of Democratic victories.

